            <p class="Division"><a name="1.2"></a>Appendix 1.2<br />Additional Information on Smart Growth and Traditional Neighborhood Developments</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1099012.html#1.2.010">1.2.010</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;What Is Smart Growth?</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1099012.html#1.2.020">1.2.020</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;What Is New Urbanism and Traditional Neighborhood Development?</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1099012.html#1.2.030">1.2.030</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SmartCode</p>

